1:/**
2: * browserSearch.js â€” Shared search engine for Meridian
3: *
4: * Exports two groups:
5: *   A) Index management  â€” initTabIndex(), rebuildIndex()  (called from background.js)
6: *   B) Search functions  â€” search(query), getPreviousTab() (called from popup.js / meridian.js)
7: */
